<html><head><title>Different tasks</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px;">What </span><span style="margin: 0px;">different roles</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> and tasks exist in a transdisciplinary team?</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">And</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">what</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">about</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">you</span><span style="margin: 0px">—</span><span style="margin: 0px">how</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">can</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">you</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">participate</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">contribute</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> project?</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Check this page now, but especially while </span><span style="margin: 0px">you’re</span><span style="margin: 0px"> working on the project.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><font color="#000000"><br></font></span></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">The </span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">theory</span><span style="margin: 0px"> page</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">discusses</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">three</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">core</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">tasks</span><span style="margin: 0px">: </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">acting</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_Emb